sequenceDiagram
    participant App as "Application<br/>startup"
    participant Spring as "Spring Boot<br/>Environment"
    participant Props as "application.yml<br/>spring.rabbitmq"
    participant Config as "erp-infrastructure<br/>RabbitMQConfig"
    participant Infra as "Rabbit broker<br/>(external)"
    participant Beans as "Queue / Exchange / RabbitTemplate<br/>(beans)"

    App->>Spring: start
    Spring->>Props: read rabbitmq properties
    Spring->>Config: instantiate RabbitMQConfig bean
    Config->>Beans: create Queue, Exchange, Binding, RabbitTemplate
    Beans->>Infra: publish/consume messages
